    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I've got a heifer that just had a rumenotomy done yesterday morning. I need a clear protocol for what I should be looking for over the next week to make sure she doesn't get an infection or any other complications. Can you give me a step-by-step on what to monitor and how to handle her diet for the next few days?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
